{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"695cd78273e0ae8b7d4d8652df136647b8176716ed7279584f6bd047574676ff","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"3JN","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"约翰三书","commonName":"约翰三书","title":"约翰三书","order":64,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"9073915f2c8ded0e194e3a1e60b1ad98804c75b951666506bc59b78800df3b90","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/3JN/1.json","firstChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"3JN","chapter":1},"lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/3JN/1.json","lastChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"3JN","chapter":1},"totalNumberOfVerses":15},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["问候"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["作长老的写信给亲爱的该犹，就是我诚心所爱的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["亲爱的兄弟啊，我愿你凡事兴盛，身体健壮，正如你的灵魂兴盛一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["有弟兄来证明你心里存的真理，正如你按真理而行，我就甚喜乐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我听见我的儿女们按真理而行，我的喜乐就没有比这个大的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["合作和反对"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["亲爱的兄弟啊，凡你向作客旅之弟兄所行的都是忠心的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他们在教会面前证明了你的爱；你若配得过 神，帮助他们往前行，这就好了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因他们是为主的名",{"noteId":0},"出外，对于外邦人一无所取。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所以我们应该接待这样的人，叫我们与他们一同为真理做工。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我曾略略地写信给教会，但那在教会中好为首的丢特腓不接待我们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["所以我若去，必要提说他所行的事，就是他用恶言妄论我们。还不以此为足，他自己不接待弟兄，有人愿意接待，他也禁止，并且将接待弟兄的人赶出教会。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["亲爱的兄弟啊，不要效法恶，只要效法善。行善的属乎 神；行恶的未曾见过 神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["低米丢行善，有众人给他作见证，又有真理给他作见证，就是我们也给他作见证。你也知道我们的见证是真的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["问安"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我原有许多事要写给你，却不愿意用笔墨写给你，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但盼望快快地见你，我们就当面谈论。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["愿你平安。众位朋友都问你安。请你替我按着姓名问众位朋友安。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"原文是那名","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/3JN/1.json","thisChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"3JN","chapter":1},"thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JUD/1.json","nextChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"JUD","chapter":1},"nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2JN/1.json","previousChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"2JN","chapter":1},"previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"thisChapterAudioTimings":{},"nextChapterAudioTimings":{},"previousChapterAudioTimings":{},"numberOfVerses":15,"simpleChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/3JN/1.simple.json"}